  "features_and_traits": [
    "Expertise in Insight and Investigation.",
    "Sneak Attack: 2d6 extra damage once per turn when its conditions are met.",
    "Cunning Action: Dash, Disengage, or Hide as a Bonus Action.",
    "Steady Aim: gain Advantage on the next attack roll if he has not moved that turn; his Speed becomes 0 for the turn.",
    "Mage Hand Legerdemain: cast Mage Hand as a Bonus Action and make it invisible; control it as a Bonus Action and use it for Dexterity (Sleight of Hand) checks.",
    "Weapon Mastery: Rapier (Vex) and Light Crossbow (Slow).",
    "Fey Ancestry: Advantage on saves to avoid or end Charmed.",
    "Keen Senses: Survival proficiency.",
    "Trance: does not need sleep, cannot be magically put to sleep, and can finish a Long Rest in 4 hours of trancelike meditation.",
    "Elven Accuracy feat: increase one of Dexterity, Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma by 1; reroll one die once when making an advantaged attack using one of those modifiers.",
    "Alert feat: add +2 to Initiative and may swap Initiative with a willing ally immediately after rolling."
